<entry><title>GitHoods: Hood view: The Cyanotype Network</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://board.studiowetware.com/p/githoods/#cp-4"/><id>tag:board.studiowetware.com,2026-10-24:githoods/hood-view-the-cyanotype-network</id><published>2026-10-24T12:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-24T12:00:00Z</updated><category term="Build"/><summary type="text">Build. The Cyanotype Network repo drawn as a Hood in the 3D view. Its folders (js, pages, supabase and assets) are districts around the civic center, and each file is a building. Selecting a file lights the wires to the files it connects to, here config.js, admin.js, db.js, style.css...</summary></entry>
<entry><title>GitHoods: World map</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://board.studiowetware.com/p/githoods/#cp-3"/><id>tag:board.studiowetware.com,2026-10-24:githoods/world-map</id><published>2026-10-24T12:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-24T12:00:00Z</updated><category term="Build"/><summary type="text">Build. The World view at 41 Hubs, 3,047 repos and 315 scanned Hoods. Each Hub is a block of hex tiles in one color, with its repos as named tiles. The map can be searched by Hub or repo name and filtered by language.</summary></entry>
<entry><title>GitHoods: Public release</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://board.studiowetware.com/p/githoods/#cp-2"/><id>tag:board.studiowetware.com,2026-10-21:githoods/public-release</id><published>2026-10-21T12:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-21T12:00:00Z</updated><category term="Release"/><summary type="text">Release. The site has three views: Hood, Hub and World. A Hood is a single repo, drawn as a 3D town on a hex tile that can be rotated and zoomed. A Hub is an owner's account and holds all of their Hoods. The World view is one continent of hex territories, one per Hub, placed oldest fir...</summary></entry>
