<entry><title>AI Station: How AI Station works</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://board.studiowetware.com/p/ai-station/#cp-1"/><id>tag:board.studiowetware.com,2026-10-17:ai-station/how-ai-station-works</id><published>2026-10-17T12:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-17T12:00:00Z</updated><category term="Note"/><summary type="text">Note. AI Station runs local language models on a Raspberry Pi 5 to produce written work in stages. A single launcher starts a chosen studio, and each studio runs a fixed set of agents in order. A marketing studio moves a brief through research, strategy, creative, copy and productio...</summary></entry>
